control: A body the port or the conversion refuses is recorded refused, never scanned, and not fetched again
removes: a rendering refusal is ignored, so the body is scanned as empty and recorded clean, by a tick and by the second pass
packages: ./worker/internal/backfill/pass2 ./worker/internal/backfill ./worker/app
tests: TestABodyRefusedIsRecordedRefusedAndNotFetchedAgain TestATickRecordsABodyTheConversionRefusesAsRefused
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

